ct_interr_duplicate_body:
Do naar restrictions put in place door discord, multiple interactions cannot hebben de same name.

**Effecting:**
 {0}

ct_interr_invalid_name_body:
Do naar restrictions put in place door discord, after trimming leading/trailing whitespace op an interactions name it must be less than 32 characters, en more than 1 character. If de interaction is een slash command, it must hebben less than 3 spaces, be allemaal lowercase, en not contain any characters other than letters en -s. je can use de regex `^(?:[\w-]{1,32} {0,1}){1,3}$` naar test je slash command name.

**Effecting:**
 {0}

ct_interr_subcommand_match_parent_body:
Do naar restrictions put in place door discord, een subcommand's parent must not be een command.

**Effecting:**
 {0}

ct_interr_too_many_children_body:
Do naar restrictions put in place door discord, interactions cannot hebben more than 25 children.

**Effecting:**
 {0}
